FFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]admin_center_apostrophe_jump.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/admin_center_apostrophe_jump.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-gv[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-gv/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared pane entry-jump mixin and Logs migration[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]shared[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared: add the reusable pane entry-jump mixin that owns hint [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]allocation, the pending-prefix state machine, and the bounded back [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stack, then migrate the Logs pane onto it with no behavior change.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Tasks tab jump[/bold #D7AFFF]                                                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]tasks[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shared[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tasks: wire the Tasks pane task list onto the shared mixin.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]XPrompts tab jump[/bold #D7AFFF]                                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]xprompts[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shared[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]xprompts: wire the XPrompt browser's non-header rows onto the shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mixin and reserve the apostrophe in the filter-first browser input while[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the filter is empty.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Projects tab jump across all three sub-tabs[/bold #D7AFFF]               